# Build context for tracelean/Dockerfile.ci, which is the repository root
# rather than tracelean/: the keymap test regenerates the root README.md, and
# the end-to-end differential tests run against example/. With a narrower
# context both of those silently did nothing — the example tests are written to
# skip when the project is absent, so CI reported green on checks it had never
# run.
.git
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/__pycache__
*.log

# Editor session state for this checkout. The example project's own
# `.tracelean/` is kept: drt.json, trace.lock.json and trace_policy.json are the
# bindings and policy the e2e run needs.
/.tracelean
/tracelean/.tracelean
example/.tracelean/drt
example/formal/.lake
